{"scope":"knowledge","page":6,"pageSize":24,"total":200,"totalPages":9,"items":[{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-9b213ac2c3ac","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"竖屏节奏（抖音/快手微短剧）","description":"> 竖屏短剧和横屏影视的节奏完全不同：小屏、外放、划走成本极低、常倍速看。 > 一切服务于「别让观众划走」。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["Easel-short-drama","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/Easel-short-drama/references/vertical-pacing.md","ext":".md","pack":"Easel-short-drama","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-a0f90f8d957b","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"图片提示词阶段契约","description":"本阶段只拥有 `剧集/<EP>/图片提示词.md` 中的 `IMG-...` 项：用途、参考边界和可复制正文。它继承 视觉设定与项目视觉方向，不改写资产身份、地理、剧情状态或镜头边界。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-image-prompts/references/stage-contract.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-image-prompts","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-a6953f1dc6e9","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"单集跨上下文交接胶囊","description":"长单集因为上下文限制需要分批续写时，可以在**当前会话上下文**维护一份最小交接摘要。它不落盘、 不成为第六份创作文档，也不替代 `剧本.md`。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-write/references/scene-handoff-capsule.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-write","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-a78da0d51e3a","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"Evidence-Based Review Method","description":"Start from the current creator-visible files and the constraints the creator has explicitly chosen. Prefer an uninvolved reviewer or isolated context when available; otherwise perform an honest self-check and say so in the review Markdown.…","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-review/references/review-method.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-review","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-a8666e8f5cd5","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"镜头设计方法","description":"1. [先落实原文，再追求画面](#先落实原文再追求画面) 2. [镜头目的](#镜头目的) 3. [场面调度与地理](#场面调度与地理) 4. [景别与摄影机动机](#景别与摄影机动机) 5. [时长与切镜](#时长与切镜) 6. [常见问题](#常见问题) 7. [审查问题](#审查问题)","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-storyboard/references/shot-craft.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-storyboard","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-a8ac2c40dd86","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"Assets And Asset-Image Prompt Rubric","description":"without guessing?","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-review/references/rubric-assets-prompts.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-review","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-a8e5b846af9e","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"关键场景 Coverage Audition","description":"Coverage audition 在正式 shots 前比较真正不同的导演方案，避免第一种合理做法直接成为唯一答案。 它不是固定镜头数、固定宫格或自动变体器；创作者选择之后才投影为正式场次视觉计划和 shots。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-storyboard/references/coverage-audition.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-storyboard","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-aaaeba384778","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"表演弧、动作预算与节奏","description":"表演和故事变化是否仍可读，不套通用“每秒几个动词”公式。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-video-prompts/references/performance-action-timing.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-video-prompts","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-aba3b9545976","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"目标模型能力档案","description":"本套件的模型相关规则一律写成“按目标模型确认”，但“确认”在实践中经常没有落点：没人知道要确认 哪几件事，于是提示词按最保守的写法交出去，执行端再靠自己补——补出来的往往就是漂移。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-video-prompts/references/target-model-profile.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-video-prompts","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-ade877195651","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"视觉设定阶段契约","description":"本阶段只拥有 `剧集/<EP>/视觉设定.md` 中的人物/造型、地点/视图、道具/状态、声音身份与跨场连续性。 它继承剧本事实，不决定镜头瞬态、构图、动作终点或生成提示词。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-assets/references/stage-contract.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-assets","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-ae68703b68c4","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"动作的可生成性","description":"1. 什么时候适用 2. 判据：这个动作在日常影像里常见吗 3. 四类高风险写法 4. 戏剧信息从哪里来 5. 改写方法 6. 失败征兆与审查问题","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-video-prompts/references/generability.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-video-prompts","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-aea74ab07c2d","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"场次视觉戏剧计划","description":"场次视觉计划是正式分镜前的可选思考层，回答整场怎样改变观众位置、空间压力、观看节奏和声音注意。 它不是第二份剧本，也不拥有镜头边界。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-storyboard/references/scene-visual-plan.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-storyboard","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-af0c3fa86664","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"台词技法（dialogue craft）——治「台词功底差 / 像 AI」","description":"> 写 `script.md` 的对白、抽 `lines.json` 前必读。目标：台词像\"偷听到的人话\"，不像\"AI 在互相念说明书\"。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["Easel-short-drama","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/Easel-short-drama/references/dialogue-craft.md","ext":".md","pack":"Easel-short-drama","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-afb8e6c21834","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"镜头修订与稳定身份","description":"镜头 ID 表示同一个编辑/导演决定的连续身份，不等于列表位置，也不等于外部制作任务编号。 修订时先判断镜头的叙事职责是否仍是同一个，再决定保留、创建或 retire。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-storyboard/references/shot-revision-identity.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-storyboard","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-b19a64c5f925","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"Look Development：把视觉方向变成可比较的代表帧","description":"Look development 不是给全剧粘一个风格标签，也不是让参考图接管角色和剧情。它把创作者 接受的 `visual_direction` / `production_profile` 投影成少量**文本风格帧规格**，让人物、地点与 高压力场景在正式分镜前共用一套可观察视觉语言。本阶段只产出规格和提示词；创作者要求 实际出图时交给 `$short-drama-produce`，并对它展示的精确任务预览明确确认。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-drama","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama/references/look-development.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-b3047a4b0ebd","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"短剧故事开发方法","description":"1. 使用方式与规则分级 2. 从题材词到戏剧承诺 3. 设计能持续运转的冲突引擎 4. 让人物成为压力的制造者 5. 用状态变化判断升级 6. 管理信息、证据与兑现 7. 让主题进入选择 8. 生成真正不同的方案 9. 从引擎走向分集 10. 合成示例 11. 失败征兆与审查问题","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-develop/references/story-craft.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-develop","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-b491f2bb1b88","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"去标识 Promotion Ledger","description":"Promotion ledger 记录“哪项公共规则为什么被晋升、缩窄、暂缓或退休”，让维护者能复核 匿名评测、定位准确公共 diff 并回滚。它不是私有证据摘要，也不是排行榜。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-knowhow/references/promotion-ledger.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-knowhow","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-b6632de7b28f","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"入驻与账号","description":"来源：操作手册 https://www.tiktokdramacenter.com/help-center/detail/6a053db7186bcf04b44c0222 （2026-08-13 13:30）","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["opc-skills-tiktok-drama…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/opc-skills-tiktok-drama-center/references/onboard.md","ext":".md","pack":"opc-skills-tiktok-drama-center","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-b880c5d4bd11","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"因果节拍法（causal beats）——让剧情「有逻辑地上头」，不是流水账","description":"> 剧情简单/散，多半是「然后…然后…」的流水账。好剧本是**因果链**：每个节拍都由上一个 > **导致**，主角的选择推动下一步。本文给单集的因果节拍模板 + 爽点密度要求，配合 > `genre-hooks-handbook.md`（选题材/钩子）与 `four-act-drama.md`（四幕结构）使用。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["Easel-short-drama","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/Easel-short-drama/references/causal-beats.md","ext":".md","pack":"Easel-short-drama","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-b9c45958674c","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"视频提示词审查量表与合成案例","description":"1. 审查顺序 2. 证据量表 3. 完成前结构检查 4. 合成正例 5. 合成反例","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-video-prompts/references/review-and-fixtures.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-video-prompts","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-ba869b3010dd","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"契约与所有权","description":"```text 开发? -> 剧本 -> 视觉设定 -> 图片提示词 \\-> 分镜 -> 视频提示词 \\-> 明确确认后的媒体生产 ```","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-drama","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama/references/contract-and-ownership.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-bb5e2f6076f8","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"Story And Script Rubric","description":"audience payoff without relying on a genre label? misunderstanding, humiliation, rescue, or reveal?","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-review/references/rubric-story-script.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-review","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-bfe5501f07b8","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"Creator-first 工作流","description":"每集按需维护五份创作者可读 Markdown：","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-drama","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama/references/creator-workflow.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-c1e9fbad3e30","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"Scoped Edit 与自然语言修订","description":"每次 edit 都声明精确目标/区域、要改什么、必须保留什么，以及预期的连续性影响。如果期望变更会 改写身份或已确认上游事实，路由给该 owner，不要伪装成局部提示词修订。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-image-prompts/references/edit-and-revision.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-image-prompts","bytes":null}}]}
